                "Diagram post load took {0} msec.", (endTime - startTime));

        // issue 1725: the root is not set, which leads to problems
        // with displaying prop panels
        Object model = getModel();

        LOG.log(Level.INFO, "Setting root model to {0}", model);

        setRoot(model);

